msgid "The **Sound** page is the same for every machine."
msgstr "La página **Sound** es la misma para todas las máquinas."

msgid "Beeper"
msgstr "Beeper"

msgid ""
"The beeper is the machine's own speaker, and every machine has it. Its "
"volume is **Beeper** on the **Sound** page. **MIC in the beeper**, in the"
" **ULA** group of **Machine: Advanced Settings**, also mixes the signal "
"the machine sends to the tape into the beeper sound, a tenth as loud, as "
"a machine with a ULA does (see [Advanced settings](options-machine.md"
"#advanced-settings))."
msgstr ""
"El beeper es el altavoz propio de la máquina, y todas las máquinas lo "
"tienen. Su volumen es **Beeper** en la página **Sound**. **MIC in the "
"beeper**, en el grupo **ULA** de **Machine: Advanced Settings**, mezcla "
"también en el sonido del beeper la señal que la máquina envía a la cinta,"
" a una décima parte de volumen, como hace una máquina con ULA (consulta "
"[Advanced settings](options-machine.md#advanced-settings))."

msgid "Recording the sound"
msgstr "Grabar el sonido"

msgid ""
"**Capture > Record Sound to WAV...** writes what you hear to a file; see "
"[Capture menu](capture.md)."
msgstr ""
"**Capture > Record Sound to WAV...** escribe en un archivo lo que oyes; "
"consulta [Menú Capture](capture.md)."

